#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: flooring-calculator.php
msgid "Flooring Calculator for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Calcolatore pavimenti per WooCommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: flooring-calculator.php
msgid ""
"Converts between area, length and sales unit on WooCommerce product pages "
"and shows the total price instantly. For flooring, underlay, adhesives, "
"skirting boards, panels and profiles."
msgstr ""
"Converte superficie, lunghezza e unità di vendita nelle pagine prodotto di "
"WooCommerce e mostra subito il prezzo totale. Per pavimenti, sottofondi, "
"adesivi, battiscopa, pannelli e profili."

#. Author of the plugin
#: flooring-calculator.php
msgid "Patrick Schlesinger"
msgstr "Patrick Schlesinger"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: flooring-calculator.php
msgid "https://www.cms-admins.de/"
msgstr "https://www.cms-admins.de/"

#: flooring-calculator.php:108
msgid ""
"Flooring Calculator for WooCommerce needs WooCommerce to be installed and "
"active."
msgstr ""
"Calcolatore pavimenti per WooCommerce richiede che WooCommerce sia "
"installato e attivo."

